  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Morally Bankrupt</strong></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">the \"what'd you'd do for money\" party card game that will have everyone laughing and disturbed at your next gathering.</span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Hilarious convos: Read a card to your friends then debate, decide, and defend why you&rsquo;d stoop so low.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">From tame to traumatizing: Contains 160+ cards filled with questionable topics, including some &lsquo;fill in the blank&rsquo; and &lsquo;create your own&rsquo; cards for maximum replayability.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Idiot proof: Read the card out loud. Discuss. Laugh.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Want more? We&rsquo;re brand new so enjoy the first edition for now. We&rsquo;ll get around to expansion packs eventually. FFS give us a minute to rest our disgusting brains.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Guaranteed LOLZ: If you can read these cards and not laugh, recommend a visit to the doctor of your choice.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>WARNING: Play with family at your own risk! :)&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"a-row a-spacing-mini\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 680px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 2